[I] Cisco router emulator

[T] Dynamips emulates Cisco 1700, 2600, 3600, 3700 and 7200 series routers
[T] by running real Cisco IOS images. It is used for network labs,
[T] certification training and testing, and as the backend for GNS3.

[U] https://github.com/GNS3/dynamips

[A] Dynamips Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 0.2.25
[L] GPL

[D] 6c24be5b18d8f7e1a090353852d282525aa009bf61de9b20c0358a32 dynamips-0.2.25.tar.gz https://github.com/GNS3/dynamips/archive/v0.2.25/

# the microcode converter must run on the build host
atstage cross && hook_add preconf 5 '$BUILDCC -Icommon -Istable -o rom2c.native common/rom2c.c -lelf' &&
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DROM2C_EXECUTABLE=$PWD/rom2c.native'
